  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.<br>• Peel and cut pumpkin into wedges. <br>• Cut carrot and zucchini into bite-sized chunks. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68f1ad18c310625e1718d662/step-72151c00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic &amp; herb spice blend and season with salt. Toss to coat.<br>• Place carrot and zucchini on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat.<br>• Roast veggies until tender, 20-25 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68f1ad18c310625e1718d662/step-95216b10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When veggies have 10 mins remaining, boil the kettle. To a large heatproof bowl, add couscous and the stock powder.<br>• Add the boiling water (3/4 cup for 2P / 1 1/2 cups for 4P) and butter, then stir to combine. Immediately cover with a plate and leave for 5 mins. Fluff up with a fork and set aside.<br>• When veggies are done, add roasted carrot and zucchini to couscous. Add baby spinach and a drizzle of vinegar. Toss to combine. Season to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68f1ad18c310625e1718d662/step-cb5f9d20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide roast veggie couscous between bowls. Top with roast pumpkin.<br>• Crumble over fetta cubes.<br>• Top with a dollop of dill &amp; parsley mayonnaise to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68f1ad18c310625e1718d662/step-0cf70c30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
